<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 116,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 116,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts were 116,000 head, compared with the estimate of 110,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales of barrows and gilts were $1.00 per cwt lower than midsession on Monday.</p>
